Description: Video2ArabicSubs — videos to Arabic subtitles (SRT/VTT)
 Speech-to-text with OpenAI Whisper and translation to Arabic using an
 offline local model (Argos Translate) by default, with Google Translate
 as an explicit option.
 .
 Features: batch translation of whole folders in natural path order,
 SRT and/or VTT output written next to each video, optional subtitle
 burn-in, a promotional credit cue, and a modern bilingual (Arabic /
 English) desktop interface plus an optional web interface.
 .
 The package ships only the application sources (~1 MB). On first run the
 dependencies are installed automatically into a per-user virtual
 environment at ~/.cache/v2as/venv (re-run anytime with: v2as --setup).

